      "context_text": "Okay, I just wanted to say good morning to everyone. I know my students are still coming in and joining us and I see we have a number of other guests. I'm happy to have you with us this morning. or this evening depending on where you are in the world. I know we have a global audience today. It's pretty exciting I think. I'm glad we have this opportunity.",
