      "context_text": "By Janindra, a greeting if you do meet James in your community and you'd like to offer a proper greeting. With that said, let me introduce you to, some of the people we'll be hearing from today. So, the leading guru or teacher, as my students should know, for the community of Jains we'll be learning from, is Rashtrasant Param Gurudev Sri Namramuni Maharaj Sahi. His community sees him as a Jain saint whose thoughts, words, and work are an inspiration for people around the world. For his community, he's not only a profound visionary, but also humanitarian, working to engender a positive difference in countless lives globally. He's the founder of Parastham, a socio-religious organization in India with humanitarian initiatives and spiritually uplifting missions across the world. So far, he's inspired 37 young women and men to accept renunciation in the Jain tradition.",
