      "context_text": "We'll learn more about, about the guru, Sri Namramuni Maharaj Sahib as we go. But I want to introduce our speaker today, Param Asmitaji Mahasataji, who is one among the disciples of Gurudev. She's a leading cosmetologist, having treated renowned celebrities in India, and her life underwent a complete transformation when Asmitaji Mahasatji heard just one audio CD of Param Gurudev's discourse on the real identity of the soul. After deep contemplation, she decided to adopt Jain Diksha, that is renunciation from the materialistic world in 2016 under the guidance of Gurudev. Since then she's dedicated her life in the pursuit of truth. She has been delivering online discourses on various subjects of Jainism for devotees from various countries like the United States, but also the UK, Malaysia, Singapore, UAE, Sudan, Congo, Sweden, and Australia.",
